// ONE ENTRY PER TOOL — the old TILES + NAV_BUTTONS maps
// duplicated className/icon/href across 19 keys, which is
// how `sfg-movement-dashboard -icon.svg` (note the stray
// space) ended up wrong in both. Now each tool is declared
// once and both surfaces are derived from it:
//   key       — unique id
//   label     — tile caption (uppercase house style)
//   navLabel  — sidebar tooltip; falls back to label
//   className — drives BOTH the tile and the nav button, and
//               is what addRedirectListener() binds to
//   icon      — filename appended to iconBase
//   href      — target route
//   tile      — optional, false = no home tile
//   nav       — optional, false = no sidebar button
// ====================================================


// --------------------------------------------------
